<title>NETHERLANDS: Volker Stevin order book up 10 pct end-96.</title>
<headline>Volker Stevin order book up 10 pct end-96.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Volker Stevin NV said on Friday it had orders on its books worth 2.021 billion guilders at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>It said this represented an increase of 10 percent over the end of 1995 when it had orders worth 1.843 billion guilders on its books.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
